<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Final S.African maize estimate held at 9.484 mln T.</title>
<headline>Final S.African maize estimate held at 9.484 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's National Crop Estimates Committee said on Friday its seventh and final estimate of the 1996 maize crop was unchanged at 9.484 million tonnes, up from 4.406 million in 1995.</p>
<p>However, the sunflower seed estimate was increased to 730,000 tonnes from 720,000, against 450,000 in 1995.</p>
<p>This year's maize crop comprises 5.44 million tonnes of white maize and 4.044 million tonnes of yellow.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
